1
00:00:00,558 --> 00:00:03,308
Come on, we'll take your mom
to see the Hollywood sign...

2
00:00:03,478 --> 00:00:05,688
(Mrs Cooper:)...the Wax Museum,
the Walk of Fame.

3
00:00:05,855 --> 00:00:07,235
(Penny:)Ooh. Maybe a little Rodeo Drive.

4
00:00:07,398 --> 00:00:10,358
Well, I can't spend $12,000
on a handbag...

5
00:00:10,526 --> 00:00:15,076
(Mrs Cooper:)...but it's free to look upon those
who do with righteous condemnation.

6
00:00:17,533 --> 00:00:20,163
- What do you say?
- What do I say?

7
00:00:20,328 --> 00:00:24,748
(Sheldon:)I say you people need to stop ruining
my mom's visit with your sushi...

8
00:00:24,916 --> 00:00:27,046
(Sheldon:)...and your sadness
and your slutty shirts.

9
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:28,840
(Sheldon:)Stop it.

10
00:00:32,507 --> 00:00:36,347
(Howard(after Raj whispers to him):)He's not talking about your shirt.
Your shirt is fine.

11
00:00:39,931 --> 00:00:41,761
(Leonard:)These are delicious.

12
00:00:41,933 --> 00:00:46,273
(Mrs Cooper:)The trick to pancakes is bacon grease.
I cook everything in it.

13
00:00:46,437 --> 00:00:49,107
(Leonard:)Everything?
Aren't you worried about your heaIth?

14
00:00:49,315 --> 00:00:51,195
(Mrs Cooper:)Doctors are always changing
their mind.

15
00:00:51,359 --> 00:00:53,109
(Mrs Cooper:)One week bacon grease
is bad for you.

16
00:00:53,277 --> 00:00:55,817
(Mrs Cooper:)Next week
we're not getting enough of it.

17
00:00:57,615 --> 00:00:59,195
(Mrs Cooper:)Good morning, Shelly.

